<main><section class="intro"><div class="intro-copy"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR STAY, WITH A LITTLE LOCAL HELP</p><h1>The Zungu <br><em>Guide.</em></h1><p class="intro-text">Goba &amp; Dar, through a local lens.<br>Places to explore. The essentials you need.</p><a class="explore-link" href="#explore">Explore the guide <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><div class="intro-image"><img src="../assets/images/optimized/exterior-blossom-900.webp" width="1200" height="800" alt="Zungu Hotel’s facade framed by flowering branches" decoding="async" loading="lazy"><span>YOUR STAY. YOUR STARTING POINT.</span></div><span class="edition">01 / GOBA & BEYOND</span></section>
