<div class="results" id="results-start"><div class="guide-context"><p class="eyebrow">A GOOD PLACE TO START</p><h3 id="context-title" tabindex="-1">Where shall we start?</h3><p id="context-copy"></p><p id="care-note" hidden>For an emergency, contact local emergency services directly. Hotel staff cannot provide emergency medical care.</p><a id="category-ask" data-guide-event="guide_ask_zungu" href="https://wa.me/255766003050?text=ZUNGU%20HOTEL%0AGuide%20%C2%B7%20Local%20help%0A%0AHello%20Zungu%20Hotel%2C%0A%0AI'm%20staying%20with%20you%20%2F%20planning%20my%20stay%20and%20need%20some%20local%20help.%0A%0AI'm%20looking%20for%3A%0A%0AThank%20you.%0A%0AReference%3A%20%5BWEB-GUIDE-HELP%5D" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask Zungu Hotel ↗</a></div><p id="collection-note" class="collection-note" hidden></p><div class="results-top"><p id="result-count" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p>Good places. At your pace.</p></div><div class="active-filter" id="active-filter" hidden></div><div class="cards" id="cards"></div><div class="empty" id="empty" hidden><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><h3>A different direction?</h3><p id="empty-copy">Try another search or clear your filters.</p><button id="empty-reset" class="contact">Show all places</button><a id="empty-ask" class="empty-ask" data-guide-event="guide_ask_zungu" href="https://wa.me/255766003050?text=ZUNGU%20HOTEL%0AGuide%20%C2%B7%20Local%20help%0A%0AHello%20Zungu%20Hotel%2C%0A%0AI'm%20staying%20with%20you%20%2F%20planning%20my%20stay%20and%20need%20some%20local%20help.%0A%0AI'm%20looking%20for%3A%0A%0AThank%20you.%0A%0AReference%3A%20%5BWEB-GUIDE-HELP%5D" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask Zungu for a suggestion ↗</a></div><div class="saved-footer" id="saved-footer" hidden><p>Your list is saved on this device.</p><a id="share-list" data-guide-event="guide_saved_ask_zungu" class="text-link" href="https://wa.me/255766003050?text=ZUNGU%20HOTEL%0AGuide%20%C2%B7%20Local%20help%0A%0AHello%20Zungu%20Hotel%2C%0A%0AI'm%20staying%20with%20you%20%2F%20planning%20my%20stay%20and%20need%20some%20local%20help.%0A%0AI'm%20looking%20for%3A%0A%0AThank%20you.%0A%0AReference%3A%20%5BWEB-GUIDE-HELP%5D" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask Zungu about my places ↗</a></div><p class="travel-note">Goba is your base; places marked “Across Dar” are outings further afield. “Nearby” means in Goba, not a measured distance. Check the destination pin, current hours, access and costs before you go. Public listings are not hotel endorsements.</p></div></div></section>
